{"content":[{"c":["SAILORS"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Men trained in sailing ships at sea. The people of Israel were not generally seafaring and confined their activities on the water to the Sea of Galilee and the Jordan River. Occasionally, they may have had contact with large ships (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.49.13","r":"Gen.49.13","rawR":"Gen.49.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.49.13","value":"Gen.49.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 49:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.5.17","r":"Judg.5.17","rawR":"Judg.5.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.5.17","value":"Judg.5.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 5:17"},"). Solomon had a fleet of ships at Ezion-geber on the Gulf of Aqaba (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.9.26-28","r":"1Kgs.9.26-28","rawR":"1Kgs.9.26-28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.9.26-28","value":"1Kgs.9.26-28"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 9:26-28"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.8.17-18","r":"2Chr.8.17-18","rawR":"2Chr.8.17-18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.8.17-18","value":"2Chr.8.17-18"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 8:17-18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.9.21","r":"2Chr.9.21","rawR":"2Chr.9.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.9.21","value":"2Chr.9.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:21"},"). Jehoshaphat, too, had a fleet at Ezion-geber (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.22.48","r":"1Kgs.22.48","rawR":"1Kgs.22.48","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.22.48","value":"1Kgs.22.48"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 22:48"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.20.35-37","r":"2Chr.20.35-37","rawR":"2Chr.20.35-37","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.20.35-37","value":"2Chr.20.35-37"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 20:35-37"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["The NT frequently mentions ships and sailors—the numerous fishing boats on Galilee (",{"href":"?bref=Matt.14.22","r":"Matt.14.22","rawR":"Matt.14.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.14.22","value":"Matt.14.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 14:22"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Mark.1.19","r":"Mark.1.19","rawR":"Mark.1.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Mark.1.19","value":"Mark.1.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mk 1:19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Mark.3.9","r":"Mark.3.9","rawR":"Mark.3.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Mark.3.9","value":"Mark.3.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"3:9"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.5.2","r":"Luke.5.2","rawR":"Luke.5.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.5.2","value":"Luke.5.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 5:2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=John.6.19,22-24","r":"John.6.19,22-24","rawR":"John.6.19,22-24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.6.19,22-24","value":"John.6.19,22-24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jn 6:19, 22-24"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=John.21.8","r":"John.21.8","rawR":"John.21.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.21.8","value":"John.21.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"21:8"},") and the large ships such as the one in which Paul traveled to Rome (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.27.6-44","r":"Acts.27.6-44","rawR":"Acts.27.6-44","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.27.6-44","value":"Acts.27.6-44"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 27:6-44"},"). Shipmen or sailors are mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.27.27,30","r":"Acts.27.27,30","rawR":"Acts.27.27,30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.27.27,30","value":"Acts.27.27,30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 27:27, 30"},". The term “mariner” (",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},") refers to a sailor (",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.27.9,27-29","r":"Ezek.27.9,27-29","rawR":"Ezek.27.9,27-29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.27.9,27-29","value":"Ezek.27.9,27-29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 27:9, 27-29"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jon.1.5","r":"Jon.1.5","rawR":"Jon.1.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jon.1.5","value":"Jon.1.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jon 1:5"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Travel_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Travel_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Travel_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Travel"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Sailors","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 49:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.49.13","rawQueryValue":"Gen.49.13","sourceRefExact":"Gen.49.13"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 5:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.5.17","rawQueryValue":"Judg.5.17","sourceRefExact":"Judg.5.17"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 9:26-28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.9.26-28","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.9.26-28","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.9.26-28"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 8:17-18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.8.17-18","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.8.17-18","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.8.17-18"},{"anchorText":"9:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.9.21","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.9.21","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.9.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 22:48","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.22.48","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.22.48","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.22.48"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 20:35-37","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.20.35-37","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.20.35-37","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.20.35-37"},{"anchorText":"Mt 14:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Matt.14.22","rawQueryValue":"Matt.14.22","sourceRefExact":"Matt.14.22"},{"anchorText":"Mk 1:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Mark.1.19","rawQueryValue":"Mark.1.19","sourceRefExact":"Mark.1.19"},{"anchorText":"3:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Mark.3.9","rawQueryValue":"Mark.3.9","sourceRefExact":"Mark.3.9"},{"anchorText":"Lk 5:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.5.2","rawQueryValue":"Luke.5.2","sourceRefExact":"Luke.5.2"},{"anchorText":"Jn 6:19, 22-24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=John.6.19,22-24","rawQueryValue":